            "source_segment_index": 3013,
            "start_ms": 5445500,
            "end_ms": 5449560,
            "text": "本剧版行为机械狼通灵师是神人阵营通灵师"
          },
          {
            "index": 3014,
            "source_segment_index": 3014,
            "start_ms": 5449560,
            "end_ms": 5450120,
