          {
            "index": 3054,
            "source_segment_index": 3054,
            "start_ms": 5526930,
            "end_ms": 5529050,
            "text": "就可以跟我们一起来玩网杀游戏了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3055,
            "source_segment_index": 3055,
            "start_ms": 5529050,
            "end_ms": 5531610,
            "text": "同样的我们本赛季还有三个特约赞助商"
          },
          {
            "index": 3056,
            "source_segment_index": 3056,
            "start_ms": 5531610,
            "end_ms": 5535309,
            "text": "分别是我们柠檬共和国懒赤霞以及哈尼牧场"
          },
          {
            "index": 3057,
            "source_segment_index": 3057,
            "start_ms": 5535309,
            "end_ms": 5536189,
            "text": "各位大宝师们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3058,
            "source_segment_index": 3058,
            "start_ms": 5536189,
            "end_ms": 5538789,
            "text": "也可以随时来到我们JORD师的个人主页橱窗内"
          },
          {
            "index": 3059,
            "source_segment_index": 3059,
            "start_ms": 5538789,
            "end_ms": 5540090,
            "text": "下单进行补货"
          },
          {
            "index": 3060,
            "source_segment_index": 3060,
            "start_ms": 5540090,
            "end_ms": 5541690,
            "text": "感谢各位对我们节目的喜欢"
          },
          {
            "index": 3061,
            "source_segment_index": 3061,
            "start_ms": 5541690,
            "end_ms": 5543570,
            "text": "然后现在也已经是零点过了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3062,
            "source_segment_index": 3062,
            "start_ms": 5543570,
            "end_ms": 5544370,
            "text": "现在是4月4号"
